  "question": {
    "text": "Choose the correct statements from the following<br>A. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Mn</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math> is an oil at room temperature&nbsp;&nbsp;B. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> reacts with acid to give <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>VO</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math><br>C. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CrO</mi></math> is a basic oxide&nbsp;&nbsp;D. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math> does not react with acid<br>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "NpOTL",
      "text": "A, B and D only",
      "image": null,
